---
import Card from '../../components/ui/Card.astro';
import Divider from '../../components/ui/Divider.astro';
import Specimen from '../Specimen.astro';
---
<Specimen title="Horizontal" code={'<Divider />'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes">
        <p>A hairline <code>&lt;hr&gt;</code> in the border colour, with a little space above and below. As in Stride, the light-mode border is close to the page grey, so dividers belong on raised surfaces such as cards.</p>
    </Fragment>
    <div class="sample">
        <Card padded>
            <p>Content above the rule.</p>
            <Divider />
            <p>Content below the rule.</p>
        </Card>
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Vertical" code={'<div class="row">\n    <span>One</span>\n    <Divider vertical />\n    <span>Two</span>\n</div>'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>Inside a flex row, a vertical divider stretches to the row's height. It is exposed as a vertical separator.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="sample">
        <Card padded>
            <div class="row">
                <span>One</span>
                <Divider vertical />
                <span>Two</span>
                <Divider vertical />
                <span>Three</span>
            </div>
        </Card>
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="With a label" code={'<Divider label="or" />'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>A short label centred between two rules, such as "or" between two options. The rules are decoration; only the label is read.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="sample">
        <Card padded>
            <p>First option.</p>
            <Divider label="or" />
            <p>Second option.</p>
        </Card>
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="On a dark band" surface="dark">
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>In the dark palette the border is a translucent black, which reads on any dark surface.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="sample">
        <Card padded>
            <p>Content above the rule.</p>
            <Divider />
            <div class="row">
                <span>One</span>
                <Divider vertical />
                <span>Two</span>
            </div>
            <Divider label="or" />
            <p>Content below the rule.</p>
        </Card>
    </div>
</Specimen>

<style>
    .sample {
        max-width: 26rem;
    }

    .row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
    }
</style>
